From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: rumisle <why-excuse-quail@duck.com>
Date: Fri, 25 Sep 2026 13:38:40 +0800
Subject: core/session: record when a step's first output arrived

Adds time.output to assistant messages: when the first reasoning, text or tool
call of the model response arrived. With time.created (request sent) and
time.streamed (response ended) that gives time to first token and generation
speed. The step publisher notes the time and sends it on session.step.streamed;
the client's generated types are regenerated (packages/client: bun run generate).

Ocelot-Patch: core/first-output-time

